# Round 18, C2-14 (follows). L §5.14.1: a binding over pads is a running read, allowed in a decision that declares
# reads pads. No reading pads konto, so no pad is dated in February: the sum over none is 0 (L §5.11), 0.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input day: date

move fix: transfers
  on day
  reads pads
  leg cash from world to konto amount sum(p.cash.amount for p in pads over month_of(day) - 1)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  day = 2026-03-10
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
q: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
